### 💡 Summary

This PR aims to create accounts and related tables and make necessary changes in the database.

### 📝 Details

- [x] Create queries and mutations in the GraphQL layer;
- [x] Create entities for accounts;
- [x] Implement necessary services;
- [x] Add the account table and some auxiliary tables;
- [x] Implement necessary model;

### 🔎 References

base branch: develop

### What this PR does
I reviewed the project of Neiroart and made some slight changes regarding its code basis and documentation:
1. Cleaned up the scripts;
2. Fixed the deprecation issues with Pillow that would pop up during execution of some scripts:
    - "DeprecationWarning: BOX is deprecated and will be removed in Pillow 10 (2023-07-01). Use Resampling.BOX instead";
    - "DeprecationWarning: ROTATE_90 is deprecated and will be removed in Pillow 10 (2023-07-01). Use Transpose.ROTATE_90 instead";
3. Removed all of the `.DS_Store` files (including those in the subfolders);
4. Added a `.gitignore` file with `.venv` and `.DS_Store` inside;
5. Added `logo.png`;
6. Modified and separated `README.md` and `README_ru.md`;
7. Added `requirements.txt` so it's a little easier to install the pip packages.
### Summary
The initial functionality has not been varied; however the project itself now looks tidier and is more pleasant to work with. Thanks to @Catalyst-42 for the great work done.

